ia-labelledby=\"t-terms\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-bar\" style=\"--m-accent:#0b5fff;--m-tint:#eef3ff\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>\n    <p><em>Effective 2026-06-02. Sample terms shown for demonstration only — replace before any public use.</em></p>\n    <h3>Welcome</h3>\n    <p>Thanks for visiting Harbor Workshop. These short terms explain the ground rules for using this site and its learning materials. Carrying on means you accept them.</p>\n    <h3>How you can use it</h3>\n    <p>Feel free to read, watch and practise for your own learning. Please don't resell the materials, scrape the site, or pass paid content to others.</p>\n    <h3>About the courses</h3>\n    <p>We describe each course honestly, but details can change as we improve things. Free lessons stay free to access.</p>\n    <h3>Who owns the material</h3>\n    <p>The lessons and artwork here are the work of Harbor Workshop and its teachers. Please ask first before reusing them elsewhere.</p>\n    <h3>No guarantees</h3>\n    <p>Everything is offered for educational purposes with no warranty. How you apply what you learn is up to you.</p>\n    <h3>Get in touch</h3>\n    <p>Questions about anything here? Reach us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@harborworkshop.example\">hello@harborworkshop.example</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lg-modal-overlay\" id=\"modal-cookies\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"t-cookies\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-bar\" style=\"--m-accent:#0b5fff;--m-tint:#eef3ff\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-cookies\">Cookie Policy</h2>\n    <p><em>Cookie notice, dated 2026-06-02.</em></p>\n    <h3>Essential only</h3>\n    <p>This site relies on one functional cookie that stores your consent preference in your browser. Nothing else is required to run the pages.</p>\n    <h3>Not collected</h3>\n    <p>We don't deploy marketing cookies or share data with advertising partners.</p>\n    <h3>Opting out</h3>\n    <p>Decline optional cookies using the banner, or remove site data via your browser at any point — course access is unaffected.</p>\n    <h3>Help</h3>\n    <p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@harborworkshop.example\">hello@harborworkshop.example</a> with any privacy queries.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lg-modal-overlay\" id=\"modal-contact\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"t-contact\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-bar\" style=\"--m-accent:#0b5fff;--m-tint:#eef3ff\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-contact\">Contact us</h2>\n    <p>We are happy to help with questions about the course.</p>\n    <h3>Email</h3>\n    <p><a href=\"mailto:hello@harborworkshop.example\">hello@harborworkshop.example</a></p>\n    <h3>Phone</h3>\n    <p>+353 1 555 0150</p>\n    <h3>Address</h3>\n    <p>Harbor Workshop<br>3 Castle Hill<br>Dublin, D02 X285<br>Ireland</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='lg_cookie_consent';\n  var banner=document.getElementById('lg-cookie');\n  try{ if(localStorage.getItem(KEY)){ banner.classList.add('hidden'); } }catch(e){}\n  function set(v){ try{ localStorage.setItem(KEY,v); }catch(e){} banner.classList.add('hidden'); }\n  var a=document.getElementById('lg-accept'),d=document.getElementById('lg-decline');\n  if(a)a.addEventListener('click',function(){set('accepted');});\n  if(d)d.addEventListener('click',function(){set('declined');});\n  function open(id){document.getElementById(id).classList.add('open');}\n  function close(el){el.classList.remove('open');}\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal]').forEach(function(t){\n    t.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();open(t.getAttribute('data-modal'));});\n  });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.lg-modal-overlay').forEach(function(ov){\n    ov.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target===ov)close(ov);});\n    var c=ov.querySelector('.lg-close');if(c)c.addEventListener('click',function(){close(ov);});\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n    if(e.key==='Escape'){document.querySelectorAll('.lg-modal-overlay.open').forEach(close);}\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n\n</body></html>",
